Give the scripts sfall's traits, viewport, knockback and heave-ho calls

What the known mods call that CE lacked: Fallout Et Tu remove_trait (and
add_trait, its counterpart), the Megamod set_viewport_x/y and the knockback
mods (in its hs_tohit), Olympus apply_heaveho_fix.

- remove_trait and the add_trait metarule change the player's two traits as
  sfall does.
- get/set_viewport_x/y read and move the part of the world map in view.
- set/remove_weapon/target/attacker_knockback set the knockback of a weapon or
  critter, to a value or multiplied by it, where the engine works out a hit's
  knockback (and that of damage without an attacker); kept until the game is
  reset, by the object's unique id, as in sfall.
- apply_heaveho_fix: Heave Ho! adds 6 hexes per rank to a throw's range, after
  Strength caps it, and asks for any Strength.
